---
description: Frontend architecture, Modern Web Guidance (MWG), Baseline standards, and zero-CLS layout stability
globs: **/*.{tsx,jsx,vue,svelte,ts,js}
alwaysApply: false
---
Keep components Server Components by default; only use 'use client' at interactive leaf nodes.
Target Baseline Widely Available primitives following Google Chrome Modern Web Guidance (MWG).
Use native <dialog> with top-layer animation (@starting-style), Popover API, CSS Anchor Positioning, Container Queries, and field-sizing: content before reaching for external UI packages.
Reserve dimensions on dynamic elements and images to prevent layout shift (targeting CLS <= 0.1, 0 on first-party DOM).